# 统一换行符：文本文件在仓库与检出一律使用 LF，
# 消除 Windows（core.autocrlf）与其他平台协作时产生的整文件伪差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本要求 CRLF，否则可能无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件禁止任何换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.glb binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.basis binary
